<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov wheat imports down by 21.4 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov wheat imports down by 21.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 7.61 million tonnes of wheat in the first 11 months of this year, down 21.4 percent compared with the same 1995 period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>China's wheat imports were 760,000 tonnes in November alone, the figures showed.</p>
</text>
